# dlmalloc 2.8.6 — license and provenance

**Author:** Doug Lea. **Version:** 2.8.6, dated 2012-08-29.

The first lines of `malloc.c` state that Doug Lea released dlmalloc into
the public domain and reference CC0 1.0:

https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

The source included here is an unmodified copy of
`libs/container/src/dlmalloc_2_8_6.c` from Boost.Container 1.92.0:

https://github.com/boostorg/container/blob/boost-1.92.0/src/dlmalloc_2_8_6.c

On 2026-11-22, the checked-in `malloc.c` was compared in full with the
upstream source above; both UTF-8 texts were identical (221,525 characters).
The code's own license declaration remains intact in `malloc.c`. This file
records that declaration and source; it does not relicense the code under the
port's `LICENSE-PORT.md`.

**Role:** `android_port/src/android_lowmem.c` uses dlmalloc mspaces in a
low-address heap on arm64. This is third-party code, not ROM/game artwork.
